// dawn's mist, "too light for searchlights to be of much use". Faulknor, Obedient, Marvel, Onslaught and Narwhal fire 17
// torpedoes at 1,700-3,500 yd (Maenad later at 4,000-5,000); one hit, Pommern, blows up with all hands. Onslaught is hit,
